    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/2aa00ba48a05f7a81018ea5830399a65.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/2aa00ba48a05f7a81018ea5830399a65.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/2aa00ba48a05f7a81018ea5830399a65.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you had found tranquility, secluded from the world, duty calls you back : your best friend has been taken by a corrupted tyrant for ominous designs. Soon, you are bound to break your oath of peace and take back in hand your rusted trusted sword, a magical entity by your side to alleviate your burden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike deckbuilder game your spells are represented by tiles. Place them in a timeline where you can foresee your opponent intents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/9f39bfa881975207692d2423dd0d9eb2.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/9f39bfa881975207692d2423dd0d9eb2.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/9f39bfa881975207692d2423dd0d9eb2.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful of your enemies adapting to your strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/043ded5fae46267f478fcb9ea7bfcf39.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/043ded5fae46267f478fcb9ea7bfcf39.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/043ded5fae46267f478fcb9ea7bfcf39.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your tiles with upgrades along the way. Every tiles can get any upgrades, find your own unique destructive combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/fe1446136d63beaeba50a4868b942f0d.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/fe1446136d63beaeba50a4868b942f0d.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/fe1446136d63beaeba50a4868b942f0d.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barter better tiles with the trader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet with the blacksmith to strengthen your timeline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the power of your deck with relics you will find when defeating tougher enemies and bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your path to the Devious King and discover what lies behind its madness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/e81f8286fe4d02451fc4d769edd13bb9.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/e81f8286fe4d02451fc4d769edd13bb9.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/e81f8286fe4d02451fc4d769edd13bb9.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/2aa00ba48a05f7a81018ea5830399a65.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/2aa00ba48a05f7a81018ea5830399a65.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/2aa00ba48a05f7a81018ea5830399a65.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you had found tranquility, secluded from the world, duty calls you back : your best friend has been taken by a corrupted tyrant for ominous designs. Soon, you are bound to break your oath of peace and take back in hand your rusted trusted sword, a magical entity by your side to alleviate your burden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike deckbuilder game your spells are represented by tiles. Place them in a timeline where you can foresee your opponent intents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/9f39bfa881975207692d2423dd0d9eb2.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/9f39bfa881975207692d2423dd0d9eb2.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/9f39bfa881975207692d2423dd0d9eb2.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful of your enemies adapting to your strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/043ded5fae46267f478fcb9ea7bfcf39.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/043ded5fae46267f478fcb9ea7bfcf39.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/043ded5fae46267f478fcb9ea7bfcf39.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your tiles with upgrades along the way. Every tiles can get any upgrades, find your own unique destructive combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/fe1446136d63beaeba50a4868b942f0d.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/fe1446136d63beaeba50a4868b942f0d.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/fe1446136d63beaeba50a4868b942f0d.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barter better tiles with the trader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet with the blacksmith to strengthen your timeline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the power of your deck with relics you will find when defeating tougher enemies and bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your path to the Devious King and discover what lies behind its madness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/e81f8286fe4d02451fc4d769edd13bb9.poster.avif?t=1745499217\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/e81f8286fe4d02451fc4d769edd13bb9.webm?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/e81f8286fe4d02451fc4d769edd13bb9.mp4?t=1745499217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
